                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "2D arcade platformer in which you control a ninja balancing on a ball and avoiding obstacles\n\n✅Interesting idea controlling a chain of 5 ninjas moving on balls\n✅Ability to perform two types of jumps (only ninjas or ninjas together with balls), which adds some variety\n✅Possibility to play locally for up to 5 people\n\n❌Some hitboxes require perfect timing\n❌Repeating soundtrack\n❌The price is too high\n❌Poor graphics\n❌No graphics settings\n\n❌❌ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [b] Bad [/b], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [strike] Good [/strike], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested game)\n\n[quote] If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url] \n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask. I'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!! Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
